# Key names and instructions only. Never put real values or secrets in this template.
# Add local values in .env.local and production values in Render's Environment settings.
# VITE_* values are exposed to the browser; never use them for secrets.

# Add your Clerk publishable key: pk_test_... locally, pk_live_... in Render for production.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Google Maps Platform browser key: address suggestions (Places API (New)) and the map preview
# (Maps Static API) in the Add property form. Public by design (Vite ships VITE_* to the browser),
# so lock it down in Google Cloud Console > APIs & Services > Credentials:
#   - Application restriction: HTTP referrers cbenvironments.com, staging.cbenvironments.com,
#     testadmin.cbenvironments.com and test.cbenvironments.com:5174.
#   - API restriction: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Maps Static API. Set a daily quota.
# Owner: paste your local key here, and add the same name in Render's Environment settings.
# Blank is fine: the address field then works as plain text.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
